{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":800,"y":-200,"width":1600,"height":80,"color":"6","text":"# THE LITTLE SOLDIER — The Italian Campaign, 1796–1797\n*Full campaign flow: all events, choices, and paths*"},
		{"id":"v_group","type":"group","x":-340,"y":-80,"width":1660,"height":3100,"color":"6","label":"VOLTRI — 10 April 1796"},
		{"id":"v_camp_grp","type":"group","x":860,"y":80,"width":380,"height":660,"color":"4","label":"Camp Events"},
		{"id":"v_prologue","type":"text","x":280,"y":0,"width":380,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"# Voltri Prologue\n*Interlude*\n\nItaly. April, 1796. The Army of Italy — poorest in the Republic. Bonaparte takes command.\n\nYou are garrisoned at Voltri on the Ligurian coast."},
		{"id":"v_camp","type":"text","x":280,"y":220,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"# Voltri Camp\n*Garrison — 8 Actions*\n\nStarving, unpaid, but the coast is beautiful. Rest, Exercise, Duties, Socialize, Arms Training."},
		{"id":"v_opening","type":"text","x":280,"y":440,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"2","text":"# Battle Opening\n*Alarm at Midday*\n\nAustrian columns on the heights. Drums beat the générale. Morin: \"FALL IN!\" Vidal: \"Hold this ground, Fourteenth.\""},
		{"id":"v_v1","type":"text","x":280,"y":640,"width":380,"height":80,"color":"2","text":"# Volley 1 — 150 paces\nFirst volley. Austrians climbing the slope. Étienne steady. Luc shaking."},
		{"id":"v_v2","type":"text","x":280,"y":800,"width":380,"height":80,"color":"2","text":"# Volley 2 — 100 paces\nSecond volley hits home. Austrian return fire — man killed nearby."},
		{"id":"v_fix","type":"text","x":280,"y":960,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# Fix Bayonets\n*Story Beat — Single Choice*\n\nAustrians charge uphill, bayonets levelled. \"FIX BAYONETS!\" Steel clicks on muzzles. The column hits the line."},
		{"id":"v_melee","type":"text","x":280,"y":1160,"width":380,"height":100,"color":"1","text":"# Pegli Hills Melee\n*Skirmish — 3 opponents, 8 rounds*\n\nOlive trees and stone walls. 2 conscripts + 1 line infantryman. Solo."},
		{"id":"v_breaks","type":"text","x":280,"y":1360,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# The Line Breaks\n*Story Beat 11 — 2 Choices*\n\nWithdrawal order from Lt. Vidal. Uhlans spotted east. \"We're pulling out — NOW!\""},
		{"id":"v_fallback","type":"text","x":60,"y":1560,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"4","text":"**Fall Back**\n*Safe*\n\nOrderly retreat with Morin and the section.\n\n- Morale +3\n- Stamina −15"},
		{"id":"v_cover","type":"text","x":620,"y":1560,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3","text":"**Cover the Retreat**\n*Valor check*\n\nStay behind, fire at skirmishers.\n\n- **Pass:** SoldierRep +3, Morale +5\n- **Fail:** Health −8, Morale −2"},
		{"id":"v_coast","type":"text","x":280,"y":1780,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# The Coastal Road\n*Story Beat 12 — Night March*\n\n40km in the dark. No lights, no drums. A soldier collapsed at the roadside."},
		{"id":"v_help","type":"text","x":60,"y":1980,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3","text":"**Help the Straggler**\n*Constitution check*\n\nHaul him up.\n\n- **Pass:** SoldierRep +2\n- **Fail:** Stamina −20"},
		{"id":"v_keep","type":"text","x":620,"y":1980,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"**Keep Moving**\n*Safe*\n\nStep around the fallen man.\n\n- Morale −2"},
		{"id":"v_cavalry","type":"text","x":280,"y":2200,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# Cavalry Scare\n*Story Beat 13 — Uhlans in the Dark*\n\nHooves in the darkness. \"Cavalry. Uhlans.\" No cover. Present bayonets."},
		{"id":"v_stand","type":"text","x":60,"y":2400,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3","text":"**Stand Firm**\n*Valor check*\n\nBayonet out. Whatever comes.\n\n- **Pass:** Morale +5\n- **Fail:** Health −6, Morale −3"},
		{"id":"v_scatter","type":"text","x":620,"y":2400,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"**Scatter and Hide**\n*Safe*\n\nDive off the road. Press flat.\n\n- Morale −2, SoldierRep −1"},
		{"id":"v_dawn","type":"text","x":280,"y":2620,"width":380,"height":100,"color":"3","text":"# Dawn at Savona\n*Story Beat 14 — Final*\n\nSavona appears. 40km march over. The gates open. What do you do?"},
		{"id":"v_collapse","type":"text","x":60,"y":2800,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"**Collapse and Sleep**\n\nFind a wall. Let exhaustion take you.\n\n- Health +10, Stamina +20\n- Morale +3"},
		{"id":"v_findunit","type":"text","x":620,"y":2800,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"**Find Your Unit**\n\nReport to Morin. Do the soldier's duty.\n\n- SoldierRep +2\n- OfficerRep +2"},
		{"id":"v_survived","type":"text","x":280,"y":2960,"width":380,"height":60,"color":"4","text":"## BATTLE OVER: Survived — Dawn at Savona"},
		{"id":"v_campfire","type":"text","x":900,"y":100,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Campfire Stories**\n*Forced — 8 actions rem*\n\nÉtienne talks about the Revolution.\n- Join in (CHA) / Stay quiet"},
		{"id":"v_coastnight","type":"text","x":900,"y":220,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**The Coast at Night**\n*Forced — 5 actions rem*\n\nMediterranean under the stars.\n- Write letter / Watch the sea"},
		{"id":"v_smoke","type":"text","x":900,"y":340,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Smoke on the Heights**\n*Forced — 2 actions rem*\n\nAustrian campfires on the ridgeline.\n- Stay calm (VAL) / Report (AWR)"},
		{"id":"v_rations","type":"text","x":900,"y":480,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Short Rations**\n*Random — 25%*\n\nLuc stares at your portion.\n- Share with Luc (CON) / Keep rations"},
		{"id":"v_merchant","type":"text","x":900,"y":600,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Genoese Merchant**\n*Random — 25%*\n\nOutrageous prices. Half-filled sacks.\n- Check goods (AWR) / Haggle (CHA)"},
		{"id":"v_death_line","type":"text","x":-300,"y":700,"width":240,"height":80,"color":"1","text":"## Killed in Action\n*Line death — Pegli Heights*"},
		{"id":"v_death_melee","type":"text","x":-300,"y":1180,"width":240,"height":80,"color":"1","text":"## Killed in Action\n*Melee death — Hilltop*"},
		{"id":"v_rout","type":"text","x":-300,"y":2200,"width":240,"height":80,"color":"1","text":"## Routed\n*Broke and ran*"},
		{"id":"campaign_link","type":"text","x":940,"y":2960,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"6","text":"*→ Campaign continues → Interludes → Rivoli →*"},
		{"id":"r_group","type":"group","x":1600,"y":-80,"width":1800,"height":4400,"color":"6","label":"RIVOLI — 14 January 1797"},
		{"id":"r_camp_grp","type":"group","x":2860,"y":60,"width":400,"height":840,"color":"4","label":"Camp Events"},
		{"id":"r_prologue","type":"text","x":2200,"y":0,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"# Rivoli Prologue\n*Interlude*\n\nItaly. January, 1797. Joubert's 10,000 hold the plateau against Alvinczi's 28,000. Bonaparte rides through the night. Masséna marches behind him.\n\nThe plateau is yours to hold."},
		{"id":"r_camp","type":"text","x":2200,"y":220,"width":400,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"# Rivoli Camp\n*Eve of Rivoli — 16 Actions*\n\nThe 14th makes camp. Austrian columns massing below. Full activity set available."},
		{"id":"r_opening","type":"text","x":2200,"y":440,"width":400,"height":120,"color":"2","text":"# Battle Opening\n*Dawn on the Plateau*\n\nJanuary cold. Gunfire erupts too early. Pierre checks his flint. JB grips his musket. The drums roll. \"Present arms!\""},
		{"id":"r_part1","type":"text","x":2200,"y":620,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"6","text":"## PART 1: THE LINE"},
		{"id":"r_v12","type":"text","x":2200,"y":740,"width":400,"height":80,"color":"2","text":"# Volleys 1–2\n*120 → 80 paces*\n\nFirst contact. Fighting on the right flank. Man killed at V2."},
		{"id":"r_wounded","type":"text","x":2200,"y":900,"width":400,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# Wounded Sergeant\n*Story Beat 5 — 3 Choices*\n\nDuval takes a ball in the thigh. Spontoon clatters. \"Sergeant's down!\" The section has no NCO."},
		{"id":"r_takecommand","type":"text","x":1900,"y":1100,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"3","text":"**Take Command**\n*Valor + CHA*\n\nPick up the spontoon.\n- **Pass:** Grace 🌿\n- **Fail:** Voice cracks"},
		{"id":"r_rally","type":"text","x":2180,"y":1100,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"3","text":"**Rally the Men**\n*Charisma check*\n\nCan't replace Duval. But you can shout.\n- **Pass:** Line steadies\n- **Fail:** Lost in the crash"},
		{"id":"r_keephead","type":"text","x":2460,"y":1100,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"4","text":"**Keep Your Head Down**\n*Safe*\n\nNot your job. Not your rank. Pierre takes over. No one notices."},
		{"id":"r_v34","type":"text","x":2200,"y":1320,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"# Volleys 3–4\n*50 → 25 paces*\n\nPierre hit at V3 — shoulder, still fighting. Enemy charging at V4. Left flank breaking. Point blank."},
		{"id":"r_fix","type":"text","x":2200,"y":1500,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"3","text":"# Fix Bayonets\n*Melee Transition*\n\nLeft flank crumbles. White coats pour through the gap. Leclerc: \"FOURTEENTH! EN AVANT!\""},
		{"id":"r_terrain","type":"text","x":2200,"y":1680,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"1","text":"# Terrain Melee\n*4 opponents, 12 rounds*\n\nVineyards and stone walls. 2 conscripts + 1 line + 1 veteran. Solo combat."},
		{"id":"r_battery","type":"text","x":2200,"y":1880,"width":400,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# The Battery\n*Story Beat 1 — 2 Choices*\n\nAustrians overrun French guns. Leclerc: \"Will you let them take your guns?!\" Pierre's eyes: valor. The real thing."},
		{"id":"r_charge","type":"text","x":1920,"y":2080,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"1","text":"**Charge the Battery**\n\nRun across open ground toward the guns. Pierre beside you.\n\n→ Battery Melee"},
		{"id":"r_holdback","type":"text","x":2520,"y":2080,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"**Hold Back**\n\nLet braver souls lead. Watch from fifty paces.\n\nShame. Battery taken without you."},
		{"id":"r_battery_melee","type":"text","x":2200,"y":2280,"width":400,"height":120,"color":"1","text":"# Battery Melee\n*4 opponents + allies*\n\nThe redoubt. 2 guards + grenadier + sergeant.\n- Pierre joins Round 3\n- JB joins Round 5"},
		{"id":"r_battery_won","type":"text","x":2200,"y":2480,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"# THE BATTERY IS YOURS\n\nFrench guns retaken. \"Turn them! Turn the guns!\" Battery roars again — this time at the Austrians."},
		{"id":"r_part2","type":"text","x":2200,"y":2660,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"6","text":"## PART 2: HOLD THE LINE"},
		{"id":"r_massena","type":"text","x":2200,"y":2780,"width":400,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# Masséna's Arrival\n*Story Beat 2 — 3 Choices*\n\nFrench drums from the south. Masséna's division hits the Austrian flank. Five minutes' rest."},
		{"id":"r_tend","type":"text","x":1900,"y":2980,"width":240,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Tend Wounds**\n\nBind cuts. Drink water.\n\n- Health + Stamina recovery"},
		{"id":"r_check","type":"text","x":2180,"y":2980,"width":240,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Check Comrades**\n\nFind Pierre and JB. See who survived.\n\n- Dynamic scenes"},
		{"id":"r_scream","type":"text","x":2460,"y":2980,"width":240,"height":100,"color":"3","text":"**Follow Screaming**\n*Constitution check*\n\nHelp the surgeon.\n- **Pass:** Save a life\n- **Fail:** \"Get away.\""},
		{"id":"r_v57","type":"text","x":2200,"y":3160,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"# Volleys 5–7\n*100 → 60 → 40 paces*\n\nFresh column. Right flank exposed. Lusignan at Affi. Bonaparte on the ridge."},
		{"id":"r_part3","type":"text","x":2200,"y":3340,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"6","text":"## PART 3: THE GORGE"},
		{"id":"r_gorge","type":"text","x":2200,"y":3460,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"3","text":"# The Gorge\n*Story Beat 3*\n\nBonaparte orders the counterattack. \"Every man to the ridge!\" The pas de charge. The gorge awaits."},
		{"id":"r_v811","type":"text","x":2200,"y":3640,"width":400,"height":160,"color":"2","text":"# Gorge Volleys 8–11\n*Fire at will — Target Selection*\n\nAustrians packed in the gorge. Choose each volley:\n- **Column** — Easy, devastating\n- **Officers** — Harder, bigger effect\n- **Wagon** — The powder wagon...\n- **Show Mercy** — Lower your musket"},
		{"id":"r_aftermath","type":"text","x":2200,"y":3880,"width":400,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"# The Aftermath\n*Story Beat 4 — 3 Choices*\n\nRivoli is won. Chasseurs sweep the plateau. Alvinczi flees. Lusignan surrenders. The 14th held."},
		{"id":"r_help_wounded","type":"text","x":1900,"y":4080,"width":240,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Help the Wounded**\n\nDescend into the gorge. Tend Austrian wounded. Mercy."},
		{"id":"r_find_comrades","type":"text","x":2180,"y":4080,"width":240,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Find Comrades**\n\nSearch for Pierre and JB. Dynamic scenes."},
		{"id":"r_sit_down","type":"text","x":2460,"y":4080,"width":240,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Sit Down**\n\nLegs stop working. Musket slides. Stare at the gorge."},
		{"id":"r_victory","type":"text","x":2200,"y":4260,"width":400,"height":60,"color":"4","text":"## BATTLE OVER: Victory — The Gorge is Silent"},
		{"id":"r_campfires","type":"text","x":2900,"y":100,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4","text":"**Austrian Campfires**\n*Forced — 10 rem*\nFires bleeding through the fog.\n- Steady nervous (CHA) / Count (AWR)"},
		{"id":"r_briefing","type":"text","x":2900,"y":210,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4","text":"**Officer's Briefing**\n*Forced — 7 rem*\n\"Front rank needs filling.\"\n- Volunteer (VAL) / Stay quiet"},
		{"id":"r_nightbefore","type":"text","x":2900,"y":320,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4","text":"**The Night Before**\n*Forced — 3 rem — Cinematic*\nFog clears. Thousands of campfires on Monte Baldo."},
		{"id":"r_bonaparte","type":"text","x":2900,"y":430,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4","text":"**Bonaparte Rides Past**\n*Forced — 1 rem*\nGrey coat, plain hat. Every man straightens.\n- Continue (VAL check)"},
		{"id":"r_pierre_story","type":"text","x":2900,"y":560,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4","text":"**Pierre's Story**\n*Random — 40%*\nPierre staring into the fire. Heavier silence.\n- Listen / Ask about Arcole (CHA)"},
		{"id":"r_short_rations","type":"text","x":2900,"y":670,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4","text":"**Short Rations**\n*Random — 40%*\nJB has already finished his bread.\n- Accept share / Share with JB (CON)"},
		{"id":"r_jb_fear","type":"text","x":2900,"y":780,"width":320,"height":90,"color":"4","text":"**JB's Fear**\n*Random — 40%*\n\"I can't do it. Tomorrow. The line.\"\n- Reassure (CHA) / Truth (VAL) / Silence"},
		{"id":"r_death_line","type":"text","x":1660,"y":800,"width":260,"height":80,"color":"1","text":"## Killed in Action\n*Line death — the ball finds you*"},
		{"id":"r_death_melee","type":"text","x":1660,"y":1720,"width":260,"height":80,"color":"1","text":"## Killed in Action\n*Melee death — the steel finds you*"},
		{"id":"r_rout","type":"text","x":1660,"y":2800,"width":260,"height":80,"color":"1","text":"## Routed\n*Broke and ran*"},
		{"id":"r_survived_out","type":"text","x":1660,"y":3500,"width":260,"height":80,"color":"2","text":"## Survived\n*Pulled from the press*"}
	],
